OL,3,GNEWSAThree men arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Ahare coursing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested following
OL,7,Freports of hare coursing in west
OL,8,FLancashire.
OL,10,FOfficers from the Rural Taskforce
OL,11,Fseized dogs, a car and equipment after
OL,12,Fbeing called to Halsall, near Ormskirk,
OL,13,Fon Saturday.
OL,15,FThe force said hare coursing - the
OL,16,Fillegal pursuit of hares using dogs,
OL,17,Foften on farmland without the owner's
OL,18,Fpermission - can leave farmers and
OL,19,Frural communities facing intimidation,
OL,20,Fand cause property damage and harm to
OL,21,Fwildlife.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
