OL,3,GNEWSAThree men arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Ahare coursing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesman said the men "will
OL,7,Fbe required to answer for their actions
OL,8,Fbefore the courts", and warned "for
OL,9,Fthose wishing to come into our area
OL,10,Fpoaching this will be your reality".
